        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Charters](/charters) · [The boat](/boat) · [Book](/book)\n\n# Reef Runner Charters\n\nPrivate day charters and sunset cruises from Gustavia harbour on a 38-foot center console.\n\n## Charters\n\n- Full day (8 hours), up to 10 guests — $2,400\n- Half day (4 hours), up to 10 guests — $1,400\n- Sunset cruise (2 hours) — $800\n- Day trip to Saint-Martin or Anguilla — $3,200, plus customs fees\n\nAll charters include captain, fuel, snorkel gear, towels, water and soft drinks. Lunch can be arranged from €35 per person.\n\n## The boat\n\nReef Runner is a 2019 38-foot center console with twin 300 hp engines, a shade top, a marine head and a Bluetooth sound system.\n\n## Your captain\n\nCaptain Ben Carter has run charters in the Caribbean since 2006 and holds a USCG 100-ton license.\n\n## Book\n\nBook on our calendar: https://fareharbor.example/reefrunner\nQuestions? WhatsApp +590 690 00 30 12 or email ben@reefrunner.example\n\nWe operate every day, weather permitting, from 8am to 7pm.\n\nPayment by card or bank transfer; a 30% deposit secures your date.\n\n© Reef Runner Charters · Terms"
      }
